# Required Environment Variables

## GROQ_API_KEY
Your Groq API key — completely free, no credit card required.

Get one at: https://console.groq.com/keys

### Local Development
Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your key:

```
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
```

### Vercel Deployment
Add this variable in your Vercel project dashboard:
  Project Settings → Environment Variables → Add New

Name:  GROQ_API_KEY
Value: gsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

> NEVER commit your real API key to git. `.env.local` is already in `.gitignore`.

